\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces Sequential RelMAE boxplots for the INTC dataset across date pairs in Local Adapt mode for Backbone Bar 1 (top), Backbone Bar 2 (middle), and Backbone Bar 3 (bottom). The horizontal dashed line at 1.00 represents the naive model baseline. Green rectangles highlight instances where covariate configurations \texttt  {05} (raw CNN-LSTM output) or \texttt  {01} (full configuration) outperformed configuration \texttt  {06} (no covariates). Red rectangles indicate date pairs where configuration \texttt  {05} exhibited significant underperformance. Black arrows mark backbone bars where the CNN-LSTM weights were updated during the preceding Global Retrain step. Note that the boxplots corresponding to configurations \texttt  {02} and \texttt  {05} of Backbone Bars 2 and 3 on 06/24, and Backbone Bar 2 on 06/27, lie above the superior margin.}}{31}{figure.caption.18}\protected@file@percent }
